{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER WATER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform into a living sphere of water.<br>Surf through pipes. Slip through cracks. Crash from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch devastating water waves. Unleash charged water blasts.<br>Turn mobility into momentum and momentum into destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water isn\u2019t just movement, it\u2019s a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix water with lava, toxic waste, and Paradox corruption to trigger explosive chain reactions.<br>Drench. Conduct. Solidify. Ruin their day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every element reacts.<br>Every encounter escalates.<br>Push the systems far enough, and they push back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creativity isn\u2019t optional. It\u2019s survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/3f38ca18f06cee9902559bc44454567a.poster.avif?t=1772558204\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/3f38ca18f06cee9902559bc44454567a.webm?t=1772558204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/3f38ca18f06cee9902559bc44454567a.mp4?t=1772558204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIFFERENT REALITIES. DIFFERENT RULES.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your world, Corel, exists across fractured realities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross into alternate versions of the same space where resources shift, hazards evolve, and combat rules change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What worked before may fail.<br>What was safe may turn volatile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt fast.<br>Exploit instability.<br>Turn shifting conditions into advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield never stays the same, and neither can you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/030b58700fd5e3899f98dec7e62f97c7.poster.avif?t=1772558204\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/030b58700fd5e3899f98dec7e62f97c7.webm?t=1772558204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/030b58700fd5e3899f98dec7e62f97c7.mp4?t=1772558204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STOP THE PARADOX</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Paradox Corruption is tearing Corel apart, warping reality and consuming everything in its path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are One, a young Legend with dangerous power and little time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through hostile floating isles and collapsing worlds to stop the Paradox before it devours what remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maddock, the ruthless leader of the Paradox on Corel, shows no mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t about playing fair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s about surviving long enough to change what\u2019s left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/1ab298f3a339059cd47554b53aacb7b9.poster.avif?t=1772558204\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/1ab298f3a339059cd47554b53aacb7b9.webm?t=1772558204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/1ab298f3a339059cd47554b53aacb7b9.mp4?t=1772558204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A SOLO GAME WITH A TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may fight alone, but you\u2019re not without allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across Corel, a small crew of misfits stands with you. Some out of loyalty. Some out of guilt. Some because they have nowhere else to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their presence shapes the world, the stakes, and the cost of failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because saving a fractured world isn\u2019t just about power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s about who\u2019s still standing when the dust settles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced by a premium cast that brings every alliance and every conflict to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/6530d2a62e758ddf70b9626e7ef30760.poster.avif?t=1772558204\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/6530d2a62e758ddf70b9626e7ef30760.webm?t=1772558204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/6530d2a62e758ddf70b9626e7ef30760.mp4?t=1772558204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2467880?t=1772558204","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/ff20bcba24feb1d95be3037ca446dd19de653562/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772558204","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/8911f722ab88dd638c48a2a8c2d305899beb2952/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772558204","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/8911f722ab88dd638c48a2a8c2d305899beb2952/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772558204","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4151000,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/bf3416e55e043195d2cea6a9bf54c0cb.avif?t=1772558204\" alt=\"Wishlist now\" width=780 height=120 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Demo Available</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the first hour of the game and explore the first Volcano Source, where water, lava, and toxic waste drive combat, exploration, and puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What\u2019s in the demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the first Volcano Source area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with water, lava, and toxic waste to trigger chain reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn, solidify, or weaken enemies using the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine fluid powers with hand-to-hand attacks for elemental combos and stylish finishers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Rahne and Vellum,\u00a0two voices you can\u2019t ignore</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download it free from the box above.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER WATER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform into a living sphere of water.<br>Surf through pipes. Slip through cracks. Crash from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch devastating water waves. Unleash charged water blasts.<br>Turn mobility into momentum and momentum into destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water isn\u2019t just movement, it\u2019s a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix water with lava, toxic waste, and Paradox corruption to trigger explosive chain reactions.<br>Drench. Conduct. Solidify. Ruin their day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every element reacts.<br>Every encounter escalates.<br>Push the systems far enough, and they push back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creativity isn\u2019t optional. It\u2019s survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/3f38ca18f06cee9902559bc44454567a.poster.avif?t=1772558204\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/3f38ca18f06cee9902559bc44454567a.webm?t=1772558204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/3f38ca18f06cee9902559bc44454567a.mp4?t=1772558204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIFFERENT REALITIES. DIFFERENT RULES.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your world, Corel, exists across fractured realities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross into alternate versions of the same space where resources shift, hazards evolve, and combat rules change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What worked before may fail.<br>What was safe may turn volatile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt fast.<br>Exploit instability.<br>Turn shifting conditions into advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield never stays the same, and neither can you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/030b58700fd5e3899f98dec7e62f97c7.poster.avif?t=1772558204\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/030b58700fd5e3899f98dec7e62f97c7.webm?t=1772558204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/030b58700fd5e3899f98dec7e62f97c7.mp4?t=1772558204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STOP THE PARADOX</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Paradox Corruption is tearing Corel apart, warping reality and consuming everything in its path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are One, a young Legend with dangerous power and little time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through hostile floating isles and collapsing worlds to stop the Paradox before it devours what remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maddock, the ruthless leader of the Paradox on Corel, shows no mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t about playing fair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s about surviving long enough to change what\u2019s left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/1ab298f3a339059cd47554b53aacb7b9.poster.avif?t=1772558204\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/1ab298f3a339059cd47554b53aacb7b9.webm?t=1772558204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/1ab298f3a339059cd47554b53aacb7b9.mp4?t=1772558204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A SOLO GAME WITH A TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may fight alone, but you\u2019re not without allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across Corel, a small crew of misfits stands with you. Some out of loyalty. Some out of guilt. Some because they have nowhere else to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their presence shapes the world, the stakes, and the cost of failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because saving a fractured world isn\u2019t just about power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s about who\u2019s still standing when the dust settles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced by a premium cast that brings every alliance and every conflict to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/6530d2a62e758ddf70b9626e7ef30760.poster.avif?t=1772558204\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/6530d2a62e758ddf70b9626e7ef30760.webm?t=1772558204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/6530d2a62e758ddf70b9626e7ef30760.mp4?t=1772558204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Emeteria"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/e39036b077d6aee96e3e0b2e7929a55c4735957e/header.jpg?t=1772558204","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 New Tales 2025 \u2013 All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><